# VITE_API_URL is OPTIONAL since the API is served from the same Vercel
# project under /api/*. Leave it unset for both production and local dev
# (the Vite dev server proxies /api to http://127.0.0.1:8000).
#
# Only set it if the API is hosted on a different origin, e.g.:
# VITE_API_URL=https://your-api.example.com
